Subject: [PATCH] Add a trusted authentication connection, isolated input and physical proof

Copyright (C) 2026 Artur Yakymenko
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

Apply after patches 0001 through 0009 on niri v26.04. The trusted command and
its environment are captured once at startup; IPC can restart only that command.
The proof is a physical keyboard action, deliberately absent from the IPC API.

